{"reviewId": "373531937_7ZBAgrlD1", "review": {"abstract": "波从萧条向回升的转换本质上就是从滞胀向通缩的转换，此时经济增速不断下降，商品价格明显回落，通缩成为社会的共识，这个过程也有10年之久。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "令人恐怖的是，我们现在所处的当下，还不是衰退期，也不是萧条期，而是回升期，且处于回升期的前半期。通缩成为共识，且又无奈。怎么办？老美招用老后，恐怕只有使用战争这一手段了。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4713-4780", "createTime": 1745334063, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "373531937_7ZBAgrlD1", "userVid": 373531937, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 373531937, "name": "王金东", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM5Ew6gV618sRaz6Wt9x7dRJObTADZYlNU8HTibFTamRgnw/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M5-0-10", "desc": "读完书籍", "title": "读完书籍", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 48036123, "name": "老许 ", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q3auHgzwzM7vGHlpUNdxRibpNEBw0VHajpRbj1M6VF29fYUl1lzDAg3VBEOpWppA9brjRyNVA2JlUjo2RHodC3U8FGBCicoLHVM7dcibfibqgyRtpUwd7RhDqA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "确实开